    "created_at": "2016-06-21T20:48:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T20:48:34Z",
    "body": "The type conversion are clear in the ECMAScript specification:\nnull -> 0\nundefined -> NaN\n\nThe maxWidth parameter is currently defined as \"unrestricted\" which mean that it must accept NaN.  What is not clear is how maxWidth=NaN should be handled by the text preparation algorithm\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
