    "created_at": "2016-06-21T20:49:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T20:49:30Z",
    "body": " https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#text-preparation-algorithm\n\nIt currently says: \"If maxWidth was provided but is less than or equal to zero, return an empty array.\"  It should probably be modified to say: \"If maxWidth was provided but is less than or equal to zero or equal to NaN, return an empty array.\"\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
